        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hn">Hn</ref> 80.4</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 80.4" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="596" ed="#liebermann"/>Forstal<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="h" target="#Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.h"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="27" target="#Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.27"/> est si quis ex transuerso incurrat uel in uiam<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="28" target="#Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.28"/> expectet et assalliat inimicum suum.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 596 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.h" n="h" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">596</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">vgl.</hi> 80, 2</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude"><hi rend="italic">cf.</hi> 80, 2</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.27" n="27" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">596</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Fores. <hi rend="italic">Co;</hi> Forestel <hi rend="italic">Sc Hg</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">Fores. Co; Forestel Sc Hg</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_80-4.lnote.oe.28" n="28" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">596</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">uia <hi rend="italic">ändert Wi Tho</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">uia emended by Wi Tho</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Hn_80-4.lnote.oe._" n="-" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">3</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">327</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">Ebd</hi>. Angriff 3; Rechtssperrung 4b.—Am Rande spät: <hi rend="italic">Hic distinguit hoc vocabulum forestalle</hi>—<hi rend="italic">forstel</hi>{27}—80, 4a <hi rend="italic">Set si potest c</hi>.—<hi rend="italic">forestel</hi>{28}—80, 5 <hi rend="italic">Stetb</hi>. Rs</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude"><hi rend="italic">Ibid</hi>. Angriff 3; Rechtssperrung 4b.—In the margin, in a late hand: <hi rend="italic">Hic distinguit hoc vocabulum forestalle</hi>—<hi rend="italic">forstel</hi>{27}—80, 4a <hi rend="italic">Set si potest c</hi>.—<hi rend="italic">forestel</hi>{28}—80, 5 <hi rend="italic">Stetb</hi>. Rs</seg></note>
